# What `docker build` leaves out of the frontend image's build context.
#
# The Dockerfile installs from the lockfile and builds from source. A host
# install, build output and local environment files would only be merged
# over the image's own by `COPY . .`: `vite build` reads the .env.*.local
# files, and a host node_modules carries its platform's native binaries and
# whatever drifted from the lockfile.
